	"power": "Give power to whoever is shouting loudest. Pump coolant before the reactor gets hot.",
	"weapons": "Keep both turrets loaded. You can only lock targets Sensors has scanned.",
	"sensors": "You have the only map. Call out distances and dangers. Tune in hails so the captain hears them.",
	"ops": "Point the shields at the danger. Keep Pudding calm with pats, snacks and music.",
}

